        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>RK International AP-PH-4880, Rustic Pipe Appliance Handle</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nIndustrial decor is much sought after and the Pipe Appliance Pull exudes a beauty in its rustic design that makes it the perfect fit for shabby chic lovers everywhere. This appliance handle is styled to look like a pipe, but with an attention to style and form. It is available in an array of finishes. Choose from a 12 inch or an 18 inch length. Made by RK International, the Pipe Refrigerator Handle can be used as such, or as a door handle with through bolts.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available Matching: <a href=\"/products/pipe-cabinet-pull-rk-international-cp-880\"><b>Pipe Cabinet Pull</b></a> and \r\n<a href=\"/products/cylinder-cabinet-knob-rk-international-ck-781\"><b>Pipe Cabinet Knob</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>PH-4880</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 13-1/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>PH-4881</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 19-3/32\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPackaged Standard with Thrubolt mounting (bolts through the door). Also available matching <a href=\"/products/pipe-pulls-pair-rk-international-ph-4900bm\">Pair Pipe Pulls Back to Back Mounted</a> door pulls for both sides of a door.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Pipe Appliance Pull",
                "description": "Industrial decor is much sought after and the Pipe Appliance Pull exudes a beauty in its rustic design that makes it the perfect fit for shabby chic lovers everywhere. This appliance handle is styled to look like a pipe, but with an attention to style and form. It is available in an array of finishes. Choose from a 12 inch or an 18 inch length. Made by RK International, the Pipe Refrigerator Handle can be used as such, or as a door handle with through bolts.\r\n",
